  "thig15.1:7.1": "",
  "thig15.1:7.2": "Modern Ayodhya in Uttar Pradesh. This is about 800 km to the north-east of Ujjain. The two cities lie on the so-called “southern road”, which leads from the prosperous cities of the Gangetic plain via Ujjain to the western trading ports on the Arabian Sea, and on to Andhra Pradesh on the east coast (see [snp5.1:36.1]()). ",
