  "thig15.1:23.4": "_Poṭṭhi_ is unique in Pali, and evidently represents the Sanskrit _pauṣṭika_, a robe used for the tonsure ceremony. Also, the father uses _ghaṭika_ (“pot”) rather than the familiar _patta_ (“bowl”). ",
  "thig15.1:24.1": "",
